DESCRIPTION:Join us for a vibrant outdoor celebration of art\, creativity\,
  and community in downtown Hudson! We’ll feature 40 artists from Hudson
 and the surrounding area in a curated open-air experience filled with orig
 inal work.\n\nEnjoy a lively atmosphere with wine\, food\, and live music
 as you explore diverse art and connect directly with the artists behind it
 .  \n\nLive music throughout the day.  Tina Bergmann and Bryan Thomas (dul
 cimer & upright bass) will play at the Gazebo from 3 to 5.  Chris Coles Gl
 eam (jazz standards and originals) will play the Gazebo from 7 to 9.
